<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 168-6 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 168-6 IN 2ND INNINGS V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 168 for six in</p>
<p>their second innings at the close on the third day of the</p>
<p>one-off cricket test against India on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 182 and 168-6. India 361.</p>
</text>
